{"c":[{"id":"227c87230dc71c8a","sum":"L1: Gemma E2B is a base model (local draft prompts are few-shot; caret-local-model refuses a request with no grammar; deadlineMs is epoch ms). Fill throws labelTooLong for a focused label over 80 chars on a page with little prose.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T201333Z-fdcac01d5471b677","text":"L1: Cotypist's Gemma E2B is a base model, so local draft prompts are few-shot documents (writer/local-draft.ts); caret-local-model refuses a request with no grammar. localTextRequest.deadlineMs is epoch ms, not a duration.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T204550Z-12e324b0b44784bf","text":"Fill throws labelTooLong when the focused field's label is over 80 chars on a page with little other prose (privacy prose share); saved answers can't be offered there.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b818cff7ff0f8991","sum":"Hosts before v2/answers throw on an unknown memoryDocument id (answers.md is listed only to savedAnswers hosts). P1: test/setup/no-groq.ts fails any test reading process.env.GROQ_API_KEY; pass explicit env objects in tests.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T204550Z-3e3d4d7a0bdec136","text":"Hosts before v2/answers throw on an unknown memoryDocument id, losing the whole memory list; the server lists answers.md only to hosts with the savedAnswers capability.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T205140Z-7ef033e31edcf1b4","text":"P1: helper/test/setup/no-groq.ts (vitest setupFiles) fails any test file that reads process.env.GROQ_API_KEY, even if the throw is caught; pass explicit env objects to readKey/writersOnStart in tests.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
